sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BCO as BCO
    participant Store as BCO State store
    participant BTO as Build-Test Orchestrator

    BCO->>Store: Acquire campaign lease
    Store-->>BCO: Campaign record, steps, attempts, next intended action
    alt next action has not been sent downstream
        BCO->>BTO: Submit plan with idempotency key
        BTO-->>BCO: Plan ID or existing plan reference
        BCO->>Store: Persist plan reference and attempt state
    else plan is awaiting terminal result
        BCO->>BTO: Read final build-test plan result
        alt plan reached terminal result
            BTO-->>BCO: Final build-test plan result
            BCO->>Store: Persist result and continue from next action
        else terminal result unavailable or plan not found (lookup status contract TBD)
            BTO-->>BCO: No terminal result available
            BCO->>Store: Fail under no-retry default, or retry per policy (oq-005)
        end
    end
